:: Disclaimer [splash-screen]

<div class="disclaimer-container" id="disclaimer-click-zone">
    
    <div class="disclaimer-header">CONTENT WARNING</div>
    
    <div class="disclaimer-text">
        This story contains graphic violence, blood and gore, death, strong language, and psychological horror.<br><br>
        This is <span style="color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: bold;">PART I : DAY ZERO</span> of an episodic survival series.<br>
        The choices you make, the people you save, and the humanity you lose will carry over into future installments.<br><br>
        Names, characters, businesses, and incidents are either the products of the author’s imagination or used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual events or locales is entirely coincidental.
    </div>

    <!-- The Audio Unlocker Prompt! -->
    <div class="click-to-start">
        [ CLICK ANYWHERE TO CONTINUE ]
    </div>

</div>

<!-- Jumps to the Title Screen (and unlocks audio!) when they click -->
<<script>>
    setTimeout(function() {
        $('#disclaimer-click-zone').one('click', function() {
            Engine.play("Title"); 
        });
    }, 500); 
<</script>>